    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/releases/tag/3.1.31"&gt;3.1.31&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Always issue HELLO when the server should understand it, not just for RESP3 by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5151380692" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3175" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3175/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3175"&gt;#3175&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix two RESP3 connect failure modes: credential desync (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5119019696" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3172" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3172/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3172"&gt;#3172&lt;/a&gt;) and subscription poisoning on downgrade (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5054446722" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3154" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3154/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3154"&gt;#3154&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5152508049" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3176" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3176/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3176"&gt;#3176&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add NOMKSTREAM/MINID support to XADD by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/HarnageaGabriel/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/HarnageaGabriel"&gt;@HarnageaGabriel&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5185872119" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3186" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3186/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3186"&gt;#3186&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add SER305/SER306: waiting for a queued transaction result by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5174580406" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3178" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3178/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3178"&gt;#3178&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add SER307 (sync over async), and a DedicatedThreads opt-in by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5180870577" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3179" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3179/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3179"&gt;#3179&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add SER308: flag the library's own Wait/WaitAll/TryWait helpers by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5181444901" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3180" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3180/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3180"&gt;#3180&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Internal bits&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Treat a write losing its connection as a closure, not an internal fault (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5082301277" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3167" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3167/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3167"&gt;#3167&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5202353800" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3189" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3189/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3189"&gt;#3189&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preparation work for smart-client-handoffs by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5143059633" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3174" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3174/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3174"&gt;#3174&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support transport feeds by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5141266588" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3173" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3173/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3173"&gt;#3173&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transport seam: start reading before the handshake, and report a tunnel's refusal by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5189699289" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3188" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3188/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3188"&gt;#3188&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Auxiliary bits&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benchmark: support -c correctly by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5096611275" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3170" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3170/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3170"&gt;#3170&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stabilize Windows CI by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5082734384" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3168" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3168/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3168"&gt;#3168&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cut the CI build time: analyzers once per project, cache NuGet by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5109135167" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3171" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3171/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3171"&gt;#3171&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Point documentation links at seredis.dev by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5181730469" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3181" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3181/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3181"&gt;#3181&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add a Jekyll config for the docs site, and switch to Cayman by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5182119569" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3182" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3182/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3182"&gt;#3182&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Docs site: title duplication, stray underlines, favicon by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5182267061" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3183" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3183/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3183"&gt;#3183&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;New Contributors&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/HarnageaGabriel/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/HarnageaGabriel"&gt;@HarnageaGabriel&lt;/a&gt; made their first contribution in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5185872119" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3186" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3186/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3186"&gt;#3186&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
